  clause 6.1.4  test 3  Xref streams shall not be used
  clause 6.3.4  test 1  The font programs for all fonts used within a conforming file shall be embedded (the card names this one)
  clause 6.7.3  test 1  /Info CreationDate and xmp:CreateDate shall be equivalent
  clause 6.7.3  test 4  /Info Subject and dc:description['x-default'] shall be equivalent
  clause 6.7.3  test 5  /Info Keywords and pdf:Keywords shall be equivalent
  clause 6.7.3  test 8  /Info ModDate and xmp:ModifyDate shall be equivalent
